OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACollector buys #18k Pokemon cards
OL,4,Ain record auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Pokemon card collector who bought an
OL,7,F#18,000 set of cards said he "had to
OL,8,Fmake his eight-year-old self happy",
OL,9,Fand that he would have been willing to
OL,10,Fspend more.
OL,12,FJoshua Nero, 29, from Ealing, west
OL,13,FLondon, bought a set of 196 cards from
OL,14,Fan auction of a Woking man's collection
OL,15,Fwhich fetched #1.56 million in total
OL,16,Fwhen it went under the hammer on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
