OL,3,GNEWSACollector buys #18k Pokemon cards
OL,4,Ain record auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FNero, who says he has been collecting
OL,7,Fcards for about 20 years, added that
OL,8,Fbuying the set shows the
OL,9,F"life-changing" value that Pokemon
OL,10,Fcards have nowadays.
OL,12,FHe told BBC Radio Surrey: "For what it
OL,13,Fis, it was quite cheap."
